  "question": "Where can I find an attraction that fall within 50 kilometers in the northwest direction of Spella Park, Algonquin, IL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.351252 42.161567)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.351252 42.161567)',4326)::geography, 50000)\nAND tourism = 'attraction'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5;\n",
